# Staging preflight — INVALID candidate environment fixture.
#
# Used by `python scripts/staging_preflight.py --dry-run` as the fail-closed
# self-test: the gate MUST fail this file for these specific reasons:
#   - AETHER_ENV=local           (env:aether-env)
#   - placeholder "changeme" JWT (env:no-placeholder-secrets)
#   - wildcard CORS origin       (env:cors-origins)
